[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://bummr6hw8gcaa"]

; One variable: the LightmapGI's shadowmask_mode, Replace. The bake in
; `unit-lightmap-gi-shadowmask.lmbake` holds a Dynamic sun's shadow in its `_shadow.png` atlas. The
; sun's real-time shadow fades out past 3 m from the camera (directional_shadow_max_distance), and
; Replace draws the baked shadow in its place. The camera sits where Godot's editor opens a scene, so
; the fade band is in frame. No other scene reads a shadowmask, so none shows a
; wrong mask read, UV2 placement, filter or mix with the real-time shadow.

